{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1061578/block/singleImage/3255534/df/01KG54KCZ6TXHQ58ZC4D071SYN.jpg?updatedAt=1793608673\"/><figcaption>將軍澳醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>將軍澳發生工業意外。 今日（2日）上午約11時半，一名51歲姓林工人於將軍澳駿日街16號一個地盤操作手提電磨機時不慎鎅傷手，同事報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，工人清醒由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理。警方經初步調查，相信他工作期間意外被機器割傷左手。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.628617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:37:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.041475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:33.361298+00:00","content_hash":"fc2316ea845f05cef23f0a08f497ba91518417ea7102638a5b7d7441cb1ec3e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.628617+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}